  "description": "Invented support values and how the engine classifies each, shared by the desktop's hanger-write predicate test and, in a later change, a test on the engine's side. \"engine\" is what is_variable_spring_hanger and is_constant_effort_support (core/product_physics/src/lib.rs, through support_hanger_type) return for the support decoded as PreviewSupport: variable_spring, constant_effort or none; document_refused where the typed decode refuses the value. Validation diagnostics that a solve adds later (missing hanger data, family tokens) are not part of it. \"gate\" is whether writesSupportHangerSelection must treat a write of the value on a support's configuration or as a created support as a hanger write; wherever engine is a hanger kind or document_refused, gate is true."
}
